<title>POLAND: Universal surges 9.9 pct in heavy trade.</title>
<headline>Universal surges 9.9 pct in heavy trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish trader Universal SA surged 9.9 percent to 13.3 zlotys in the session's high turnover on Wednesday, perhaps helped by technial factors, traders said.</p>
<p>&quot;The stock pierced a recent high in continuous trade on Tuesday -- I don't see another reason to explain today's surge,&quot; one trader said.</p>
<p>Turnover was at 33.4 million zlotys.</p>
<p>Traders also noted the stock was a favourite among domestic retail investors.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
